OL,3,AEl Salvador's president threatens
OL,4,AHaitian gangs over military hostages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were part of the so-called Gang
OL,7,FSuppression Force (GSF), approved by
OL,8,Fthe United Nations Security Council
OL,9,Fearlier this month, to tackle
OL,10,Fescalating gang violence in Haiti.
